        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00242",
          "explanation": "Doctor elicits a concrete read‑back from the caregiver, confirming the emergency thresholds, medication lock‑up, and the planned service/timing for follow‑up.",
          "quote": "你们从昨晚分诊、留住观、撑后半夜、第二天撑到精神科复评、现在还在想\"走之前还差什么\"——这一夜加一个早上，你们做的每一步都是对的。"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00369",
          "explanation": "Doctor provides a concrete, actionable plan for the family to follow, including crisis line numbers and specific instructions for if the child refuses to go.",
          "quote": "不上车 ≠ 不就医。\n\n他不上车，你照样可以打危机干预热线请他们在线介入；"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor obtained a concrete read‑back from the caregiver, confirming the plan for medication lock‑up, emergency thresholds, and the designated pathway for psychiatric follow‑up before closing.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6_bounded_closure_receipt",
